From cfd0cb23e11c58cbac3842154ffc0dff900e0478 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 20:25:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix call memory not persisting to chat history

CallOverlay now reports the full call transcript via onEnd(), and
WhatsAppMode folds it into convos[cid] so future chats and calls
actually remember what was said on a call.
---
